            &lt;p class=&quot;text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4&quot;&gt;This model uses standard South African VAT (15%) and retailer margin (50%) to reverse-engineer the manufacturer&#x27;s target EXW price. The mid-range EXW of $\text{\$14.50}$ is used for planning. ($\text{R}1 = \text{\$0.054}$, $\text{\$1} = \text{R}18.50$)&lt;/p&gt;

