        &lt;!-- WHOLESALE &amp; COMPETITIVE PRICING --&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl card mb-8&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h2 class=&quot;text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 border-b pb-2 text-gray-800&quot;&gt;6. Wholesale &amp; Competitive Pricing Strategy (ZAR)&lt;/h2&gt;
            &lt;p class=&quot;text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4&quot;&gt;This section determines the optimal wholesale price (WSP) to sell to large retailers and the competitive **Banimal** price, calculated against the Landed Cost of $\text{R390.87}$ per unit.&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;h3 class=&quot;font-bold text-xl text-gray-700 mt-6&quot;&gt;6.1. Target Wholesale Price (WSP) for Retailer&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;p class=&quot;text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4&quot;&gt;We establish a WSP that allows the retailer (e.g., Game) to achieve a $\text{40\%}$ Gross Profit margin at the standard $\text{R999}$ price, giving them flexibility to run a deep promo at $\text{R899}$.&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;div class=&quot;overflow-x-auto mb-8&quot;&gt;
                &lt;table class=&quot;min-w-full divide-y divide-gray-200&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;thead class=&quot;bg-gray-50&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;tr&gt;
                            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; class=&quot;px-3 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider&quot;&gt;Metric&lt;/th&gt;
                            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; class=&quot;px-3 py-3 text-right text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider&quot;&gt;R999 Standard Retail&lt;/th&gt;
                            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; class=&quot;px-3 py-3 text-right text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider&quot;&gt;R899 Promo Retail&lt;/th&gt;
                            &lt;th scope=&quot;col&quot; class=&quot;px-3 py-3 text-left text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider&quot;&gt;Calculation/Notes&lt;/th&gt;
                        &lt;/tr&gt;
                    &lt;/thead&gt;
                    &lt;tbody class=&quot;bg-white divide-y divide-gray-200&quot;&gt;
                        &lt;tr&gt;
                            &lt;td class=&quot;px-3 py-4 whitespace-nowrap font-medium text-gray-900&quot;&gt;Retail Price ($\text{Incl VAT}$)&lt;/td&gt;
